    <body>
    <div><h3 style="margin-top:21pt; margin-bottom:9pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
      style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:13.5pt; background-color:#ffffff">Privacy Policy of Ball Sort</span>
    </h3>
      <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">To safeguard your personal data and privacy, we have formulated this Privacy Policy in compliance with applicable laws, regulations, and industry-standard security practices. Before using our products, please pay special attention to the following provisions:</span>
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri">&nbsp;</span></p>
      <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">This Privacy Policy outlines why we collect your personal data, how we obtain it, and how we store and manage it when you use the free products provided by Novatu Information (including downloading, installing, registering for, and using our services).</span>
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri">&nbsp;</span></p>
      <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">This policy applies exclusively to Ball Sort and our provided services, and does not cover any third-party products. If our product connects to third-party products or services, please review the content and relevant privacy policies of such third-party offerings before use, and decide whether to engage with them.</span>
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri">&nbsp;</span></p>
      <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">We have highlighted in bold and italicized text the provisions of this policy that may affect your rights and obligations. Please read these sections carefully. We reserve the right to modify and update this policy at any time, so please refer to the latest version. If you do not agree to the terms of this policy, please discontinue using our products and services. Continued use of the software after any changes to this agreement will signify your acceptance of the updated terms.</span>
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri">&nbsp;</span></p>
      <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">We may also inform you of the purpose, scope, and method of collecting corresponding information through instant notifications (including pop-ups, in-page prompts, announcements, etc.). These notifications and feature update instructions form an integral part of this Privacy Policy and carry the same legal effect.</span>
      </p><h4 style="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:6pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; background-color:#ffffff">1. Collection and Use of Your Personal Data</span>
      </h4>
      <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">We collect and use your personal data in accordance with the principles of legality, propriety, necessity, and good faith. If we intend to use your personal data for purposes not specified in this policy or for additional purposes based on a specific collection purpose, we will notify you appropriately and seek your renewed consent. Below is an explanation of how we collect and utilize personal data across common data categories:</span>
      </p><h5 style="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:6pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">1.1 Marketing Data</span></h5>
      <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">To deliver personalized services, we may obtain your advertising-related information directly from you and third-party advertising partners (such as Facebook and Google) via third-party SDKs (Appsflyer and AppLovin). This includes your IP address, IDFA, Android Advertising ID (AAID), and user engagement data (such as purchase behavior and in-app actions) when you interact with our promotional content (collectively referred to as "advertising identifiers"). We may also share your advertising identifiers, user application activities (including registration, purchases, friend invitations, and user retention), and other tracking information (mobile device ID, hashed email address, demographic/interest data, and in-app browsing/actions) with third-party partners like Facebook and Google through SDKs to monitor advertising campaign effectiveness.</span>
      </p><h5 style="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:6pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">1.2 Application Data and Log Information</span>
      </h5>
      <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">This includes Open ID, IP address, IMEI, Mac address, Android ID, device ID, device model, and service usage data. We collect this information to provide you with feedback during product use.</span>
      </p><h5 style="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:6pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">1.3 Application Analytics Data</span>
      </h5>
      <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">Used for overall application analysis, including error resolution, troubleshooting, and debugging; improving services through general analytics; reviewing performance and payment processes; ensuring smooth game operation; and addressing technical issues like bug fixing.</span>
      </p><h5 style="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:6pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">1.4 Customer Support Information</span>
      </h5>
      <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">Includes name, Open ID, device ID, application version, battery status, Wi-Fi signal strength, phone storage, network type, iOS version, platform, carrier, country code, and any uploaded photos to illustrate issues. Collected to provide in-app battery reminders and customer support via email based on your needs.</span>
      </p><h5 style="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:6pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">1.5 Device and Application Information</span>
      </h5>
      <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">Includes device model, name, manufacturer, running process data, SDK version, and application package name. Collected to send you push notifications about announcements, updates, service-related information, application versions, carrier details, and network types.</span>
      </p><h5 style="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:6pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">1.6 Security Information</span>
      </h5>
      <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">Used to detect and prevent fraud and service hijacking. Collected data may vary by device OS:</span>
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri">&nbsp;</span></p>
      <ul type="disc" style="margin:0pt; padding-left:0pt">
        <li
          style="margin-top:14pt; margin-left:27.6pt; margin-bottom:14pt; text-align:justify; line-height:21pt; padding-left:8.4pt; font-family:serif; font-size:10pt; -aw-font-family:&#39;Symbol&#39;; -aw-font-weight:normal; -aw-number-format:&#39;&#39;">
          <span style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; font-weight:bold; background-color:#ffffff">Android</span><span
          style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">: Device root status, list of installed cracking software, running cracking processes, encrypted application file hashes, tampered host files, emulator detection, Android SDK API level, device boot time, brand/model, CPU architecture/model, screen resolution, sensor status, kernel version, country code, language, available memory/storage, and network type (WiFi/4G/3G).</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <h5 style="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:6pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">1.7 Exceptions to Consent Requirements</span>
      </h5>
      <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">You acknowledge that we may collect and use personal data without your consent in the following circumstances:</span>
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri">&nbsp;</span></p>
      <ul type="disc" style="margin:0pt; padding-left:0pt">
        <li
          style="margin-top:14pt; margin-left:27.6pt; text-align:justify; line-height:21pt; padding-left:8.4pt; font-family:serif; font-size:10pt; -aw-font-family:&#39;Symbol&#39;; -aw-font-weight:normal; -aw-number-format:&#39;&#39;">
          <span style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">Data is necessary for entering into or performing a contract you are a party to, or for implementing human resource management under legally formulated labor rules and collective agreements.</span>
        </li>
        <li
          style="margin-top:6pt; margin-left:27.6pt; text-align:justify; line-height:21pt; padding-left:8.4pt; font-family:serif; font-size:10pt; -aw-font-family:&#39;Symbol&#39;; -aw-font-weight:normal; -aw-number-format:&#39;&#39;">
          <span style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">Required to fulfill legal duties or obligations.</span>
        </li>
        <li
          style="margin-top:6pt; margin-left:27.6pt; text-align:justify; line-height:21pt; padding-left:8.4pt; font-family:serif; font-size:10pt; -aw-font-family:&#39;Symbol&#39;; -aw-font-weight:normal; -aw-number-format:&#39;&#39;">
          <span style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">Necessary to respond to public health emergencies or protect natural persons' lives, health, or property in emergency situations.</span>
        </li>
        <li
          style="margin-top:6pt; margin-left:27.6pt; text-align:justify; line-height:21pt; padding-left:8.4pt; font-family:serif; font-size:10pt; -aw-font-family:&#39;Symbol&#39;; -aw-font-weight:normal; -aw-number-format:&#39;&#39;">
          <span style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">Processing personal data within a reasonable scope for public welfare activities like news reporting or public opinion supervision.</span>
        </li>
        <li
          style="margin-top:6pt; margin-left:27.6pt; text-align:justify; line-height:21pt; padding-left:8.4pt; font-family:serif; font-size:10pt; -aw-font-family:&#39;Symbol&#39;; -aw-font-weight:normal; -aw-number-format:&#39;&#39;">
          <span style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">Handling personal data disclosed in accordance with legal provisions.</span>
        </li>
        <li
          style="margin-top:6pt; margin-left:27.6pt; margin-bottom:14pt; text-align:justify; line-height:21pt; padding-left:8.4pt; font-family:serif; font-size:10pt; -aw-font-family:&#39;Symbol&#39;; -aw-font-weight:normal; -aw-number-format:&#39;&#39;">
          <span style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">Other situations stipulated by laws and administrative regulations.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri">&nbsp;</span></p>
      <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">Under legal regulations, sharing or transferring de-identified personal data</span><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">—</span><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">provided the recipient cannot re-identify individuals</span><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">—</span><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">does not constitute external sharing, transfer, or public disclosure. Storage and processing of such data do not require separate notice or consent.</span>
      </p><h4 style="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:6pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; background-color:#ffffff">2. Use of Cookies and Similar Technologies</span>
      </h4>
      <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">To enhance your product experience, improve services, and proactively detect security risks, we may use cookies or similar technologies to collect and store information when you use our products/services. This involves sending one or more cookies or anonymous identifiers to your device. We do not use cookies for purposes beyond those described in this policy. You may retain or delete cookies at your discretion; clearing cookies stored in the software will delete related information.</span>
      </p><h4 style="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:6pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; background-color:#ffffff">3. Storage, Sharing, and Protection of Your Personal Data</span>
      </h4><h5 style="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:6pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">3.1 Storage</span></h5>
      <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">In accordance with our agreements, your personal data may be processed on servers located outside your country/region of residence. Regardless of server location, we take appropriate measures to protect your rights under this policy. Your information may be accessed by our global support, engineering, and other teams from your residence.</span>
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri">&nbsp;</span></p>
      <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">Marketing data collected or shared with third-party partners (e.g., Facebook, Google) may be stored on third-party SDK (Appsflyer, AppLovin) servers in the U.S. Customer support information may also be stored on U.S.-based third-party partner servers.</span>
      </p><h5 style="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:6pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">3.2 Sharing</span></h5>
      <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">We share your personal data with third parties only in the following circumstances:</span>
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri">&nbsp;</span></p>
      <ul type="disc" style="margin:0pt; padding-left:0pt">
        <li
          style="margin-top:14pt; margin-left:27.6pt; text-align:justify; line-height:21pt; padding-left:8.4pt; font-family:serif; font-size:10pt; -aw-font-family:&#39;Symbol&#39;; -aw-font-weight:normal; -aw-number-format:&#39;&#39;">
          <span style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; font-weight:bold; background-color:#ffffff">Third-Party Service Support</span><span
          style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">:</span><br><span
          style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">(a) Cloud service providers processing data identified in this policy on their servers to deliver services.</span><br><span
          style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">(b) Enabling social network logins (e.g., Google Play).</span><br><span
          style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">(c) Providing marketing and advertisements on partner platforms (Facebook, Google, Apple, Twitter, Snapchat, Appsflyer, AppLovin) and monitoring campaign effectiveness. Service providers are prohibited from retaining, using, or disclosing your data for any other purpose.</span>
        </li>
        <li
          style="margin-top:6pt; margin-left:27.6pt; text-align:justify; line-height:21pt; padding-left:8.4pt; font-family:serif; font-size:10pt; -aw-font-family:&#39;Symbol&#39;; -aw-font-weight:normal; -aw-number-format:&#39;&#39;">
          <span style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; font-weight:bold; background-color:#ffffff">Corporate Group Support</span><span
          style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">: Affiliate companies may process your data to operate the service and conduct surveys, strictly in accordance with this policy.</span>
        </li>
        <li
          style="margin-top:6pt; margin-left:27.6pt; text-align:justify; line-height:21pt; padding-left:8.4pt; font-family:serif; font-size:10pt; -aw-font-family:&#39;Symbol&#39;; -aw-font-weight:normal; -aw-number-format:&#39;&#39;">
          <span style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; font-weight:bold; background-color:#ffffff">Legal Requirements</span><span
          style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">: Personal data may be disclosed to regulators, judicial/law enforcement agencies, or other third parties for security, compliance, or legal purposes, including:</span><br><span
          style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">(a) Complying with legal obligations or processes.</span><br><span
          style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">(b) Enforcing our terms.</span><br><span
          style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">(c) Addressing security/fraud issues or protecting users.</span><br><span
          style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">(d) Investigating policy violations, detecting/preventing security/fraud/technical issues, or protecting rights/property/safety as required by law (including exchanging information with other entities for fraud prevention). Disclosures may be made pursuant to valid legal processes (e.g., subpoenas, court orders) with or without notice. If a government entity requests data without proper legal process, we may seek your permission first.</span>
        </li>
        <li
          style="margin-top:6pt; margin-left:27.6pt; margin-bottom:14pt; text-align:justify; line-height:21pt; padding-left:8.4pt; font-family:serif; font-size:10pt; -aw-font-family:&#39;Symbol&#39;; -aw-font-weight:normal; -aw-number-format:&#39;&#39;">
          <span style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; font-weight:bold; background-color:#ffffff">Mergers &amp; Acquisitions</span><span
          style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">: Data may be disclosed to third parties acquiring all or substantially all of our business, or during asset sales/transfers, as part of the transaction.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <h5 style="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:6pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">3.3 Security Measures</span>
      </h5>
      <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">We implement security measures in line with legal and industry standards to protect your personal data from unauthorized access, disclosure, loss, damage, or misuse. This includes encrypted storage/transmission, permission controls, and regular employee training on data privacy.</span>
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10.5pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri">&nbsp;</span></p>
      <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">Please note that the internet is not entirely secure, and we recommend safeguarding your personal data (e.g., using complex passwords). In the event of a data security incident, we will activate an emergency response team, implement mitigation measures, and notify you promptly (via SMS, phone, push notifications, or public announcements) of the incident</span><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">’</span><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">s impact, our response actions, and self-protection recommendations. We will also report incident handling to regulatory authorities as required.</span>
      </p><h4 style="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:6pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; background-color:#ffffff">4. Minors</span></h4>
      <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">Our services are not intended for minors, who are prohibited from using them. We do not collect personal data from minors under the applicable age limit. If you believe we have collected such data without parental/guardian consent, or if you are a parent/guardian seeking to delete this information, please contact us at [toolsnovel109@gmail.com] for prompt deletion.</span>
      </p><h4 style="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:6pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; background-color:#ffffff">5. Policy Changes</span></h4>
      <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">We may revise this Privacy Policy periodically. Revisions will be displayed via push notifications, pop-ups, announcements, or other legally compliant methods when you log in or update the app.</span>
      </p><h4 style="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:6pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; background-color:#ffffff">6. Contact and Complaints</span></h4>
      <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">For questions/complaints about data handling or this policy, or to request access, correction, deletion of your data, change consent scope, account cancellation, or opt-out of data use, please contact us at [toolsnovel109@gmail.com]. We aim to respond within 15</span><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">–</span><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">20 working days.</span></p>
      <h3 style="margin-top:21pt; margin-bottom:9pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:13.5pt; background-color:#ffffff">California Residents (CCPA)</span>
      </h3>
      <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
        style="font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;; font-size:12pt; background-color:#ffffff">This section applies to California residents under the California Consumer Privacy Act of 2018 (CCPA).</span>
      </p><h5 style="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:6pt; line-height:21pt; background-color:#ffffff"><span
